---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Marquis Harmon" description="Privacy Policy for bigpicturearchitect.com, operated by Marquis Alan Experience LLC.">
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap stack g22" style="max-width:720px">
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.4rem)">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">Marquis Alan Experience LLC operates this website. This policy explains what information we collect and how we use it.</p>
    <h3>Information we collect</h3>
    <p>When you submit the inquiry form we collect the details you provide: your name, work email, company, title, event details and objectives. Our hosting provider may also log standard technical data such as IP address and browser type.</p>
    <h3>How we use it</h3>
    <p>We use your information only to respond to your inquiry, plan any engagement you request and operate and secure this site. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
    <h3>Sharing</h3>
    <p>Form submissions are processed by our hosting provider, Netlify, and delivered to our team. We share information with others only when needed to deliver an engagement you requested or when required by law.</p>
    <h3>Your choices</h3>
    <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete the information you submitted by contacting us through the inquiry form.</p>
    <h3>Updates</h3>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The current version is always on this page.</p>

  </div></section>
</Base>
